OL,3,GNEWSAItems stolen from Man Utd Munich
OL,4,Aair disaster memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Manchester Munich Memorial
OL,7,FFoundation (MMMF) has said it was
OL,8,F"deeply saddened" after items
OL,9,Fremembering victims of the 1958 air
OL,10,Fcrash were stolen from a memorial in
OL,11,FGermany.
OL,13,FGerman newspaper Hallo Munchen said
OL,14,Fpieces were taken from a glass display
OL,15,Fcase at Manchesterplatz in Munich on
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,18,FMunich Police told local reporters the
OL,19,Fcase had been smashed with a stone.
OL,20,FThey believed it to have happened
OL,21,Fbetween 08:00 and 13:00 local time.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
