OL,3,GNEWSAItems stolen from Man Utd Munich
OL,4,Aair disaster memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe memorial marks the site of the
OL,7,Fplane crash which killed 23 people,
OL,8,Fincluding eight Manchester United
OL,9,Fplayers, as the club returned from a
OL,10,FEuropean Cup tie in Belgrade in what
OL,11,Fwas then Yugoslavia.
